<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" scale="1" border="0">
  <diagram name="Trang-1" id="LQ3fhW6wd4CHPJyiIJGY">
    <mxGraphModel dx="4450" dy="-3314" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1169" pageHeight="827" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;```plantuml\n@startuml\ntitle Activity Diagram v3 - AI-assisted Home Healthcare Scheduling\n\nskinparam shadowing false\n\nskinparam note {\n    BackgroundColor #FFFBE6\n    BorderColor #C8A951\n}\n\n|Customer / Caregiver|\nstart\n:Create Service Request;\n\nwhile (Request needs to be resubmitted?) is (Yes)\n\n    |System|\n    #LightBlue:Validate Request;\n\n    while (Is the request valid?) is (No)\n        |Customer / Caregiver|\n        :Correct missing or invalid information;\n\n        |System|\n        :Validate Request Again;\n    endwhile (Yes)\n\n    :Preliminary Staff Filter;\n\n    note right\n        Preliminary filtering ONLY:\n        - Required skill match\n        - Employee active status\n\n        Do NOT check availability,\n        existing schedules or travel here.\n    end note\n\n    if (Any preliminary candidates?) then (Yes)\n\n        |AI / ML Module|\n        :Predict Service Duration;\n        #LightGreen:Create ai_predictions Record;\n\n        note right\n            Store prediction in ai_predictions,\n            linked to service_requests.\n\n            Do NOT store predicted_duration\n            directly in service_requests.\n\n            Prediction target:\n            actual_duration = actual_end - actual_start\n        end note\n\n        |System / Scheduling DSS|\n        :Full Hard-Constraint Checking;\n\n        note right\n            Check all applicable constraints:\n            1. Skill Match\n            2. Availability\n            3. No Schedule Overlap\n            4. Preferred Time Window\n            5. Travel Feasibility\n            6. Maximum Daily Workload\n\n            Use predicted duration to calculate\n            the proposed end time and verify\n            schedule and travel feasibility.\n        end note\n\n        if (Any feasible candidates?) then (Yes)\n\n            :Soft-Criteria Evaluation;\n            :Scheduling / Optimization;\n            :Generate Recommendation;\n\n            note right\n                Only feasible candidates enter\n                soft scoring and optimization.\n            end note\n\n            repeat\n                |Coordinator|\n                :Review Recommendation / Plan;\n\n                if (Coordinator decision?) then (Approve)\n                    #Plum:Approve Recommendation / Plan;\n\n                else (Modify)\n                    :Modify Staff / Time / Plan;\n\n                    |System / Scheduling DSS|\n                    #Salmon:Re-check Full Hard Constraints;\n\n                    while (Modified plan violates any hard constraint?) is (Yes)\n                        |Coordinator|\n                        :Revise Modified Plan;\n\n                        |System / Scheduling DSS|\n                        #Salmon:Re-check Full Hard Constraints;\n                    endwhile (No)\n\n                    :Accept Modified Plan as Feasible;\n                endif\n\n            repeat while (Coordinator requests further modification?) is (Yes)\n\n            |System|\n            #Gold:Create Confirmed Assignment;\n            :Save Confirmation Details;\n\n            note right\n                Record as applicable:\n                - confirmed_by\n                - confirmed_at\n                - override_reason\n                - prediction reference / snapshot\n            end note\n\n            |Healthcare Staff|\n            :Execute Assigned Service;\n            :Record Actual Start and End Time;\n\n            |System|\n            :Calculate actual_duration;\n            :Save Service Result;\n            :Update Reports and KPIs;\n\n            note right\n                Updating reports / KPIs does NOT\n                automatically generate a new\n                recommendation.\n\n                Historical service results may be\n                used later to prepare training data\n                for model retraining.\n            end note\n\n            stop\n\n        else (No)\n\n            |Coordinator|\n            :Review Scheduling Infeasibility;\n            :Determine Whether Request Can Be Revised;\n\n            if (Can the request be revised?) then (Yes)\n                |Customer / Caregiver|\n                :Revise Requested Time or Requirements;\n                :Submit Revised Request;\n\n                |System|\n                :Close or Supersede Current Request;\n\n            else (No)\n                |System|\n                :Record No Feasible Assignment;\n                :Notify Coordinator of Unresolved Request;\n                stop\n            endif\n\n        endif\n\n    else (No)\n\n        |Coordinator|\n        :Handle No Skill-Matched Active Staff;\n        :Determine Whether Customer Can Revise Request;\n\n        if (Can the request be revised?) then (Yes)\n            |Customer / Caregiver|\n            :Revise Requirements or Requested Time;\n            :Submit Revised Request;\n\n            |System|\n            :Close or Supersede Current Request;\n\n        else (No)\n            |System|\n            :Record No Eligible Staff;\n            :Notify Coordinator;\n            stop\n        endif\n\n    endif\n\n    |Customer / Caregiver|\n    #LightBlue:Resubmit Revised Request;\n\nendwhile (No)\n\nstop\n@enduml\n```&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="wVZrtg6T-fFKrcwfPB1v-93">
